Release Notes - v1.2.0

## General

- Fixed excess blank lines before new ticket comments.
- Added a release check that reports non-closed tickets assigned to the release version.

## CLI

- Added one combined history comment for metadata changes made by `set` and `clear`.
- Added inline and file-based comment messages to metadata commands.

## Visual Studio Code

- Fix a "Cannot read properties of null (reading 'ticketFolder')" error.
- Added an Assign To command with configured names, free-form input, and assignment history.
- Added ticket creation from status-group context menus.
